  "title": "Mumze&#39;s Sticky Chicken",
  "description": "This recipe uses chicken drumettes, which is the meaty part of the chicken wing. The drumettes are baked in a sticky sauce of corn syrup, soy sauce, sugar and white wine. Fun sticky chicken. Great for parties and picnics.",
